{"w":["2026-10-05","2026-10-11"],"built":"2026-10-11T07:14Z","pending":102,"N":["","Musashi NZ describes Plant Protein as a \"vegan friendly formula\".","Nature's Way NZ describes its Pea Protein powder as a \"low-allergen, vegan protein\".","Woolworths NZ pack claim lists \"Vegan\" for these turmeric tablets.","Nature's Way NZ Kids Superfood Shake: \"Gluten free, dairy free, vegan, Non GMO, soy free.\"","Nature's Way NZ Kale Powder: \"Vegan, gluten-free, dairy free and non GMO.\"","Kellogg's product page states \"Suitable for vegans\"; the NZ page lists the same ingredients.","Twinings' English Breakfast product page (10/50/100 bags) shows a \"Vegan\" badge; ingredient is black tea.","Uncle Tobys' product page marks Shredded Wheat as \"Vegan friendly\"; ingredient is 100% whole grain wheat.","Woolworths NZ pack claim says \"Vegan friendly\"; dark choc ingredients list no dairy.","Woolworths NZ pack claim lists \"vegan; gluten free; GMO free\".","Woolworths NZ description: \"naturally gluten-free, vegan & GMO free\".","Woolworths NZ description: \"Our cider vinegar crisps are 100% vegan and gluten free\".","Trade press quoting Proper Crisps' brand manager at launch calls Big Cut Purple & Gold gluten-free, dairy-free and vegan.","Woolworths NZ pack claim lists \"Vegan; Vegetarian\".","Woolworths NZ pack claim: \"Vegan; USDA Organic\"; the coconut milk is plant milk.","Uncle Tobys' product page marks Cheerios Original as \"Vegan friendly\".","Cocobella FAQ: \"Yes, all cocobella products are vegan and vegetarian friendly.\"","Woolworths NZ pack claim says vegan, but flavour enhancer 635 (source unstated) is listed by Calbee; check first.","Pringles' Minis BBQ product page states \"Suitable for vegans and vegetarians\".","Woolworths NZ pack claim says vegan, but emulsifier 471 (source unstated) is listed; check first.","Remedy's NZ site: \"Remedy Ginger Beer is vegan friendly.\"","Remedy: \"Kombucha, Sodaly and Switchel are all vegan-friendly.\"","Ashoka's maker ADF Foods lists Bombay Biryani in its \"Ready to eat – Vegan\" range.","Woolworths NZ pack claim lists \"Vegan; Halal\"; ingredients are lentils, vegetables, oil and spices.","Ceres Organics' product page lists the bar as \"Vegetarian, Vegan, Plant Based\" with a Vegan badge."],"S":["Woolworths label","Musashi (manufacturer)","Nature's Way (manufacturer)","Woolworths NZ listing (pack claim)","Kellogg's (manufacturer)","Twinings (manufacturer)","Uncle Tobys (manufacturer)","Food & Drink Business","Cocobella (manufacturer)","Pringles (manufacturer)","Remedy (manufacturer)","Ashoka (manufacturer)","Ceres Organics (manufacturer)"],"U":["","https://nz.musashi.com/products/plant-protein","https://naturesway.co.nz/products/pea-protein-powder/","https://naturesway.co.nz/products/natures-way-kids-superfood-shake-75g","https://naturesway.co.nz/products/natures-way-kale-powder-120g","https://www.kelloggs.com.au/en_AU/products/just-right-original.html","https://twinings.com.au/products/english-breakfast","https://www.uncletobys.com.au/products/cereals/shredded-wheat/shredded-wheat","https://www.foodanddrinkbusiness.com.au/new-in-store/nz-purple-and-gold-potato-chips-hit-grocery-shelves","https://www.uncletobys.com.au/products/cereals/uncle-tobys-cheerios/original","https://cocobella.com.au/frequently-asked-questions/","https://www.pringles.com/au/products/multipack-minis/pringles-minis-BBQ-95g.html","https://www.remedydrinks.com/en-nz/products/ginger-beer-bundle","https://www.remedydrinks.com/blogs/news/are-remedy-drinks-vegan","https://adf-foods.com/our-brands/ashoka/shelf-table-products/ready-to-eat/","https://ceres.co.nz/products/12925-cacao-fig-orange-raw-wholefood-bar-50g"],"r":[["8049","Musashi Plant Protein Powder Vanilla","Musashi","320g",30.99,42.99,0,1,"","milk","p",1,1,1,1,"musashi-plant-protein-powder-vanilla","https://assets.woolworths.com.au/images/2010/8049.jpg?impolicy=wowcdxwbjbx&w=200&h=200"],["6057513","Super Food Pea Protein","Nature's Way","375g",19.49,27.95,0,1,"